{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mr Figs is a relentless top-down action puzzler where you play as Mr Figs - an adorable squid-like humanoid born through tragedy and experimentation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with nothing but explosives (and maybe a few tentacles), navigate treacherous dungeons, ethereal caverns, and scorching lava pits. Your ultimate goal? To dismantle the very lab that created you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Navigate otherworldly spaces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/blob-gif.gif?t=1742131557\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Blow up things</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/output-1-50.gif?t=1742131557\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And try not to die</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/extras/output-1-58.gif?t=1742131557\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you overcome everything that's made you and conquer this place?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122220?t=1742131557","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122220?t=1742131557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742131557","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742131557","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mr Figs is a relentless top-down action puzzler where you play as Mr Figs - an adorable squid-like hum